{"title":"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39de37a7701c491668310aaadb5169b1ec27a5b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(z) = (4 + i) z^2 + \\alpha z + \\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"19\" /> for all complex numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> are complex numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dd1c90fd1a2f6486fbdccc868c760c0b162a640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i^2 = - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />. Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5b19bf7575fdc3655bb5767980f09dbb747a8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/e/74efea4ce02738f0765b2b9d578ceb427631eadc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(i)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> are both real. What is the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1ef87f16f9ef4d6f152fad51ab6f61971d12a34e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$| \\alpha | + |\\gamma |$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b5520d7e33de4e667732c1c580dfc7a66e76e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} \\; 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)} \\; \\sqrt {2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\; 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)} \\; 2 \\sqrt {2} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\; 4 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"386\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1:\">Solution 1:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We need only concern ourselves with the imaginary portions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5b19bf7575fdc3655bb5767980f09dbb747a8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/e/74efea4ce02738f0765b2b9d578ceb427631eadc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(i)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> (both of which must be 0). These are:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/9/3193aa6927cfeb698c3b68302e132be4ad0f99db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{Im}(f(1)) &amp; = i+i\\text{Im}(\\alpha)+i\\text{Im}(\\gamma) \\\\ \\text{Im}(f(i)) &amp; = -i+i\\text{Re}(\\alpha)+i\\text{Im}(\\gamma) \\end{align*}\" width=\"258\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/565639c84ef5095e4e4cdd47c675f63a9178f1b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=\\text{Im}(\\gamma)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef86e0acaf1002167bf7e003d226ac54ecf7647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q=\\text{Re}{(\\gamma)},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" /> then we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c01e5b2a7ae990a62a14f1cf8e77f67ffe0fb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Im}(\\alpha)=-p-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f693c9cf085351cdd9b830c73d6dbbef4f49da0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Re}(\\alpha)=1-p.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" /> Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/e/11ef7cae82a4f33f113baedb0472cdd897070286.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[|\\alpha|+|\\gamma|=\\sqrt{(1-p)^2+(-1-p)^2}+\\sqrt{q^2+p^2}=\\sqrt{2p^2+2}+\\sqrt{p^2+q^2},\\]\" width=\"534\" height=\"32\" /> which reaches its minimum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/b/75bec5f95356b5621c8c473003558d5d8187a4d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/c/0bc2f876be1816c656fab9dc5b6d6b3cb2f10ff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=q=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" /> by the Trivial Inequality. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6e8243647f9655d194f393c78c4765b7d45dee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed B.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2:\">Solution 2:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8fde65fa6c575a27a2c5890aec64f939096496a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=4+i+\\alpha+\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/2/1b232b8fbe9177f41835f368040bcb396c50401c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(i)=-4-i+\\alpha \\cdot i +\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"193\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5b19bf7575fdc3655bb5767980f09dbb747a8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/e/74efea4ce02738f0765b2b9d578ceb427631eadc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(i)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> are both real we get, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b9be1d6ebced83e6254403573be09115d96bae2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\alpha+\\gamma=-i\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/7/c07af11d839913d5d4f792fe56235d930ae491b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\alpha \\cdot i+\\gamma=i\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Solving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/118e8481cc935db07b968579aa15a48031535e22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=1-i$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/66981fa3920210c6ad8dbe5e968783d5dd7520c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"11\" /> can be anything, to minimize the value we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/6/3d6dc714776522a81d7277e57165e167a83199db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gamma=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, so then the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787e99dbeb1c405bcd322eff2abfc01e87d8d6c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{1^2+1^2}=\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"19\" />. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>By: Quaratinium\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B\" title=